Z||000001||1FST2M6||01-24-2000||09:40 AM||||Malfunctioning EGR system maybe?! Under part throttle and under load is the only time that the egr system is in use. might want to try and disconnect the egr and plug the vacuum tube. If it rund fine wit out the jerky feeling then jump on fixing the egr system (i'm sorry I have NO clue how to fix any of that) just how to see if its bad.||||reg||1
